			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d923539d-dfe7-57ca-8486-9e09dcadd8c5")
	)
	(text "with its 750k smart pull-down and a 100k: off until firmware enables it. Slow rise (0.9 ms at 3.6 V),"
